{"3962620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unseen’s Parasite", "steam_appid": 3962620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unseen's Parasite is a single-player, first-person survival game set in an abandoned city overrun by spirits. Armed with detectors that sense paranormal signals and a pulse monitor, you must navigate the deadly streets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission: complete tasks that disrupt the spirits’ order and survive without being detected. Whispering detectors, a racing pulse, distorted frequencies, and fog-filled corridors—silence and paranoia will be your only companions. But remember: your ultimate goal is to destroy the spirits that have taken over this city and end their reign. That is why every task must be carried out without failure...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spirit Detection Mechanics</strong> – Use specialized detectors to locate paranormal entities through static and distorted frequencies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/e37d66960a4ccb4b312f0cb153104641.poster.avif?t=1769861880\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/e37d66960a4ccb4b312f0cb153104641.webm?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/e37d66960a4ccb4b312f0cb153104641.mp4?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pulse System</strong> – Monitor your heartbeat; take medicine to keep it steady. A high pulse means spirits can sense you more easily.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/50cbc5ef352f0cebd36377f554c57363.poster.avif?t=1769861880\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/50cbc5ef352f0cebd36377f554c57363.webm?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/50cbc5ef352f0cebd36377f554c57363.mp4?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission Progression</strong> – Reach marked buildings and crack access codes to move forward.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/e67191c34770a21367f09b403f2fd47c.poster.avif?t=1769861880\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/e67191c34770a21367f09b403f2fd47c.webm?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/e67191c34770a21367f09b403f2fd47c.mp4?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Item Delivery</strong> – Find critical items specified in your mission and deliver them to designated areas.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/1a53e4b4266694f564dcede7c4022708.poster.avif?t=1769861880\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962620/extras/1a53e4b4266694f564dcede7c4022708.webm?t=1769861880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs